function return value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("return", value)

function discard value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

function [a|] byte:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("type", "int", 8)

function [a|] pointer to pointedtype:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("add pointer depth", pointedtype)

function value as destinationtype:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("cast", value, destinationtype)

function left = right:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("equal", left, right)

function left or right:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("or", left, right)

function compare first with second and third:
    execute:
        return (first = 0 as a pointer to byte) or ((second = 0 as a pointer to byte) or (third = 0 as a pointer to byte))

discard compare (0 as a pointer to byte) with (0 as a pointer to byte) and (0 as a pointer to byte)
